{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/floarea-vista-golden-bridge-discovery-gardens","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":606,"crm_id":"1197","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Floarea Vista","slug":"floarea-vista-golden-bridge-discovery-gardens","display_address":"Discovery gardens","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Golden Bridge","price":630000,"display_price":"630K","lattitude":25.0404722,"longitude":55.1439211,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Floarea Vista from Golden Bridge is an elegant residential complex with a height of 10 floors, comprising 158 residential units of various types, including <strong>studios and apartments with one or two bedrooms</strong>. This architectural masterpiece attracts attention with its modern design and exquisite details, adding sophistication and attractiveness to the surrounding landscape.</p><p>The living spaces in Floarea Vista promise comfort and luxury with a cozy atmosphere and stylish interior decoration. Thanks to the enlarged windows that let in natural light, and the European decoration, each apartment acquires an exquisite look and comfort.</p><p>Residents can enjoy a variety of amenities such as a Smart Home system, a fully equipped kitchen and a designer lobby, providing comfort and convenience in daily life. The convenient location of the complex provides easy access to the main thoroughfares and key attractions of the city.</p><p>The Gardens and Discovery Gardens metro stations are located nearby, as well as the Ibn Battuta Mall, which makes Floarea Vista an ideal place for a comfortable and stylish lifestyle in the city.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1197/imag